title: 'TODO CRITICAL : don''t force that we keep owned files under ''owned/'''
pid: 5f4ec4da-9483-47e4-b190-9eef3cddda39
body: |2-
  Let the user do that,
  but have them write out an explicit path for each owned repo,
  including the owned/ part if that's part of it.

  Otherwise, when I switch between editing as myself and as Mr. Cheese
  and push and pull from multiple skg images,
  my DEPENDENCIES.toml file gets mangled.
